        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 4411TRT, Marietta Entry Door Lockset with Triton Lever</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Traditional Oval Marietta Handleset is a true classic. It expertly combines old world silhouettes with modern day sensibilities for a front door entrance set that will be sure to catch eyes. The Marietta Entry Door Lockset with Triton Lever will fit either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets and can accommodate doors from 1-3/4 inches to 3 inches thick. Choose from dummy or single cylinder functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> for the Oval Marietta Tubular Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li> \r\n<li>UL 180 minute fire rating</li>\r\n<li>Hardened steel bolt.</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 2-1/8\" door preparations.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Emtek Marietta Entrance Handleset with Triton Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Interior Trim: Triton Lever</li>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Height: 19\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Clearance: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Thickness: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Plate Height: 10\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Plate Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" - 3\" please specify</li>\r\n<li>Backset: either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Distance between Deadbolt and Lever Latch: 5-1/2\" c.c.</li>\r\n<li>Distance between Latch Bore to Bottom Mounting Hole: 9-7/16\" c.c.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-4401-specifications.pdf?v=1704262354\"><b>Emtek 4411 Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-Handle-C-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262297\"><b>Emtek Tubular Entryset Template Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Full Dummy Set:</b> Trim for non-working doors. It does not latch and does not lock. Usually used as matching trim for the non-working side of double doors.</li>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder:</b> From the exterior, a thumb piece operates the handleset latch and a key operates the deadbolt. From the inside, a thumbturn unlocks the deadbolt and a knob/lever operates the latch.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Oval Marietta Handleset with Triton Interior Trim",
                "description": "The Traditional Oval Marietta Handleset is a true classic. It expertly combines old world silhouettes with modern day sensibilities for a front door entrance set that will be sure to catch eyes. The Marietta Entry Door Lockset with Triton Lever will fit either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets and can accommodate doors from 1-3/4 inches to 3 inches thick. Choose from dummy or single cylinder functions.",
